 ('TXT_KEY_CWC3_COVENANT_CIV5_TEXT_1','No Flame Shall Be Forgotten. The Candlekeepers preserve the names of lost settlements in an underground archive. Each memory becomes a flame, sustaining a patient civilization devoted to Culture, Science and defensive warfare.'),
 ('TXT_KEY_CWC3_COVENANT_CIV5_HEADING_2','The Names We Carry'),
 ('TXT_KEY_CWC3_COVENANT_CIV5_TEXT_2','Permanently destroyed foreign major cities grant one Lost Flame each, up to 12. Each Flame provides +1 [ICON_CULTURE] Culture in the current Capital; every three provide +1 [ICON_RESEARCH] Science. Captures grant nothing. Cities founded by any Covenant are excluded.'),
