 ('TXT_KEY_CWC3_COVENANT_SERAPHINE_TEXT_1','High Keeper Seraphine is an elderly woman with white hair and calm, bright eyes. Her dark ceremonial robes bear silver embroidery. She carries a lantern containing an ancient flame through an underground archive illuminated by thousands of candles. Patient, reserved and reflective, she protects historical knowledge.'),
